FRANZISKA — COMPONENT LICENSE INDEX

This repository contains components under different licenses. There is no
blanket MIT grant over navigation forks, third-party libraries or resources.

Original first-party assistant code, continuity code, templates, documentation
and original SVG artwork: MIT; see LICENSE-MIT and assistant/LICENSE.

OpenClaw delta: distributed compatibly with OpenClaw's MIT license; retain
LICENSES/openclaw notices and the source tree's existing third-party notices.

Navigation deltas and reconstructed sources: the upstream GPL terms and
file-level notices apply. OsmGlass is GPL-3.0; OsmAnd code is GPL-3.0-or-later
with separate resource/library exceptions. Native core and resources retain
their own applicable licenses. See LICENSES/README.md, LICENSES/index.json,
source-components.json and the complete license texts.

Fetched build/runtime dependencies retain their declared upstream licenses.
The assistant's dependency notices are in assistant/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the repository-wide component map. Names and
credits do not replace license grants. No existing navigation APK is
redistributed by this source-focused release.
